\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 107'--108'. Carmen grammaticum cui Fundamentum puerorum inscribitur. Anf.: Dic personali verbo rectos prelocari. Ende: horum prefectos in perfectam tibi dabit. Explicit textus Fundamenti puerorum finiti per manus etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 109'--112. Carmen cui Thesaurus grammaticalis inscribitur. Anf.: Emo, condigno, puerilia dogmata signo. Ende: cetera queque dantur non per quodcunque locantur. Hic est finalis thesaurus grammaticalis. Expl. thes. gramm. a. 1409o.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 112'--127. Commentarius in idem. Anf.-Worte fehlen, alsdann wohl: quamvis iste proposiciones Theutunice sint etc. Ende: non perfecta. Expl. hic totum, infunde, da mihi potum; explicit liber, scriptor sit crimine liber.}

