\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 4--19. Item epistola Hassonis magna de concilio generali celebrando pro unione. Anf.: Univ. e. R. s. i. s. navicule Petri gubernacula inter undosi maris [procellas] recentibus --. Vidi iniquitatem et contradiccionem. Ende: pax perpetua et gloria suscipiat sempiterna, am. Expl. ep. consilii pacis reverend. mag. H. d. H. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Hierauf Verse: Clemens Urbano litem quia moverat ergo -- -- assem vix valet esse tuum, quid si lacereris.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 19'--21. Epistola Hassonis clericis missa quasi per demonem ymaginarie. Anf.: Lucifer princeps tenebrarum -- universis sociis regni nostri -- precipue moderne ecclesie principibus --. Dudum quidam Christi. Ende: sub nostri terribilis signeti caractere in robore premissorum.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 21 u. 21'. Epistola (Urbani VI.) pape ad universitatem Parisiensem. Anf.: Inc. etc. Urbanus ep. serv. serv. D. dilectis filiis rectori --. Inter ymmo. Ende: bene meriti reportetis. Dat. Rom. apud s. Mariam trans Tiberim XI. Kl. Decemb. pont. nost. anno primo.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 22. Quedam dicta notabilia b. Gregorii et brevia. Anf.: Nota quedam etc. Nota: beatus G. in prologo super dyalogum sic ait: ex occasione cure pastoralis etc. Ende: ea facile hominibus innotesci.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 22'--29. Glosa super Pater noster Hassonis. Inscriptio wie Q. 28a Nr. 7. Anf.: Divina sapiencia rebus omnibus etc. Ende: commoneamus, am. Expl.; D. graciarum acciones. Expl. Pat. nost. reverend. mag. H. d. H.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 29'--32'. Glosa super Ave Maria Hassonis. Anf.: Inc. av. M. Ave Maria. Procul dubio illam. Ende: divine miseracionis. Expl. Av. M. rever. mag. H. d. H.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 33--34. Epistola Soldani ad Clementem sextum. Anf.: Titulus soldani regis paganorum: Baltazar Dan illustris filius soldanus Babiloniorum -- visitando. Littera sold. ad pap. Cl. VI. Soldanus rex -- magno sacerdoti Romanorum --. Orthodoxe wie Q. 114 Nr. 11. Ende: permanebis redditurus. Dat. Babilonie anno nativitatis nostre XXXII, regni autem XIX.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 34--35'. Epistola Clementis ad Soldanum responsoria. Anf.: Responsiva etc. Clemens ep. -- soldano --. Candor wie Q. 114 Nr. 11. Ende: demerita puniantur. Dat. Avin. XII. Kl. Aug. pont. nost. anno primo. Expl. etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 36--66'. Epistola concilii pacis per modum dyalogi mag. H. de Hassia, qui dicitur Hasso. Anf.: Inc. ep. etc. Germinis magni Iovis vicarius vasta supereorum. Ende: temporalitatem inde ut premisi perdituram. Expl. ep. pac. rev. mag. H. d. H. doctoris in sacra pagina Parisiensis eximii; D. gr. am.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 67--71'. Collacio facta per Hassonem coram papa, (que proposita fuit per alium coram papa. Inhaltsverz.) Anf.: Inc. etc. Exaudi, Domine -- fac. Ita scribitur Dan. IX. cap. Hiis. Ende: unus pastor et unum ovile, am., fiat, fiat.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 73--79. Epistola Hassonis de contemptu mundi. Anf.: Ep. quedam rever. mag. H. d. H. doctor. in theol. eximii. Rever. domino -- Iohanni de Ebirsteyn camerario Mogontino -- Henricus Langensteyn, dictus de Hassia, -- requiem. Benigno vestre caritatis. Ende: sed ad ethera vadunt. Expl. hec nichili que pendit epistola mundum, Orbis edens facinus miserum variosque labores; D. gr.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 79--82. Epistola Hassonis ad Eberbacensem. Anf.: Inc. etc. Honorabili -- Petro de Lutern bursario Ebirbacensi H. d. H. peregrinus in terra non sua. Ollas Egipti vitare. Ende: in manibus suis invenerunt. Hierauf Verse: Si tibi divicias cumules, metalla, quid inde -- -- Hec non pretereunt tecum, sed ad ethera vadunt. Expl. etc. wie Nr. 11; Schlu\u223 \'df scheint beiden gemeinsam.}

