\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 1--13'. Item abbreviata Marsilii super ysagogis Porphirii, predicamentis Aristotelis, peryermenias Aristotelis. Anf. wie Q. 273 Nr. 3. Ende: form. pr. e. q. materialis; hec de veteri loyca sufficiant, de quo sit bened. Deus; am. Per me scriptum a. D. MoCCCo nonagesimo 2o in vigilia b. Mathei apostoli et evangeliste.}

