\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 20--30'. Regulae et paradigmata comparationis. Anf. wie D. 4 Nr. 14. Ende: adverbialiter fit ista comparacio, ut pridem, prius, primum vel prime. D. gr. -- Am Textende: Explicit pater meus -- Incipit doctus (\u252 \'fcber Kreuz verbunden)}

