\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 94. Notae Germanicae de invenienda coniunctione lunae. Anf.: Zyl an der silben eyne ri ti tis usque ad coniunccionem lune. }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 95'--100'. Tractatus de declinatione quarundam vocum Graecarum et Hebraicarum maxime a scriptoribus ecclesiasticis tritarum. Anf.: Scribitur primo elencorum: ignorantes virtutes. Ende: mamana, manna, hec sex sunt neutra. Expl. liber iste. Scribere qui nescit nullum putat esse laborem; tres digiti scribunt, corpus tamen omne laborat.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 100' u. 101. Regulae grammaticae. Anf.: Omne nomen terminatum in ris adiectivum. Ende: longam, ut acumen, argumen. Expl. regule grammaticales complete in Bacheraco et hec sunt facta ex gracia Dei.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 101' u. 102. Quaestiones de officio ecclesiastico institutae. Anf.: Quare evangelium legitur in sinistra. Ende: ante diem servat tempus aut legem. A. D. MoCCCoLXXXXo 5o feria Xa post invencionem sancte crucis finita sunt hec ex gracia Dei et cetera rupenstert. Qui me scribebam (!), Iohannes Arsten nomen habebat.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 102'--105. Principium commentarii in artem dictandi metricam scripti. Anf.: Melius est pauperem ditari quam etc. Ende: Ex labiis fundi -- prius persona loquitur. -- Der Text wird hier einem Otto de Luneborch zugeschrieben.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 105'--119'. Commentarius in Cornutum (Iohannis de Garlandia). Anf.: Cespitat in faleris, wie Q. 28 Nr. 2. Causa materialis sive subiectum. Ende: mundi i. e. miseri hominis. Expl. Cornutus per me finitus. In Minuskel: Expl. Cornutus antiquus et cetera.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Bl. 119'--127'. Commentarius in Cornutum novum. Anf. im Anschlu\u223 \'df an das Ende von Nr. 8: Incipit novus Cornutus per Iohannem dictum Geysmar sub a. D. MoCCCoLXXXX quinto in vigilia Iacobi. Quoniam iste liber aggregat in se --. Orexiam physis, wie Q. 28 Nr. 3. Ende: i. e. loco ameno semper ipsius paradyso, am. Expl. dicta textus sequentis. Hic liber pertinet Iohanni de Geismar. Letzterer Name ist sp\u228 \'e4ter durch Abenheym ersetzt.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

